description "Trandoshan Fiend

Hiss

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Hunting Blade (Purple Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Poisons on hit
-- 5% faster movement
-- 25% shorter
- ACP Scatter Gun (Flechette 2)
-- 15% more damage
-- 40% slower RoF
-- 60% slower reload
- Frag Grenade (1)
- Sonic Detonator (1)

^5Powers:
- Hunter Vision (Sense 2) ^3[CS1]
- Regenerate (Heal 2) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Fury (2)
-- 99% slower decay
- Strength (1)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Tracking Darts (4) ^3[Melee CS2]"